### Reactive Power Registers (Completed)
**Date**: December 2024  
**Description**: Implemented comprehensive reactive power capability registers for grid power factor control and Q(V)/Q(P) curve management.

**Features Added**:
- **25 New Registers**: All reactive power control parameters across 4 functional groups
- **Q(V) Curve Control**: Voltage-reactive power curve management with 5 voltage points and 4 reactive power points
- **Reactive Power Commands**: Command type, active/reactive power percentages, and power factor controls
- **Q(V) Curve Reference**: Reference voltage and filter time parameters
- **QP Priority Control**: Power percentage control points for priority-based operation
- **Volt-Watt Response Time**: Open loop response time for voltage-active power mode

**Technical Details**:
- **Units**: Voltage (0.1V), Time (0.01s), Power (%), Power Factor (0.001)
- **Registers**: 54-62, 121, 183, 185-191 (following Modbus protocol specification)
